(7596429, 1225974, 87808, '<td valign="top">I am not trying to be funny or gross here, but that kinda looks a bit like a portion of my placenta when I gave birth. And trust, me, I drew a little stick man on the photo of my placenta and called him placenta man with his house.  It was not a pretty sight.  But it just kinda looks like a wonton or a medical procedure that went very wrong, The shock and awe value is not here for this. OOOO wait, a hernia??? Inside of a testicle,,,,,,,, holy crap, I have to stop looking cus I am thinking every single mayor medical thing I can.<br/> <br/>Came back to finally vote on this. I still have no idea what it is, but just glimpsed it and now thinking one of those bags from the grocery store. Either way, I am still thinking about it. So a 6 from me.</td>', 'I am not trying to be funny or gross here, but that kinda looks a bit like a portion of my placenta when I gave birth. And trust, me, I drew a little stick man on the photo of my placenta and called him placenta man with his house.  It was not a pretty sight.  But it just kinda looks like a wonton or a medical procedure that went very wrong, The shock and awe value is not here for this. OOOO wait, a hernia??? Inside of a testicle,,,,,,,, holy crap, I have to stop looking cus I am thinking every single mayor medical thing I can. Came back to finally vote on this. I still have no idea what it is, but just glimpsed it and now thinking one of those bags from the grocery store. Either way, I am still thinking about it. So a 6 from me.', '2018-09-14 11:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
